---
// Traditional Chinese variant of Ecosystem.astro. Tool names stay English (product names).
---

<section class="ecosystem section" aria-labelledby="ecosystem-title">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <h2 id="ecosystem-title" class="ecosystem__title">基於 SpecScore 構建。</h2>

    <ul class="ecosystem__grid">
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">DataTug</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          使用 DataTug 探索資料庫結構、撰寫並執行查詢，理解查詢結果。產品需求和驗收標準由 SpecScore 規範指導。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://datatug.app" target="_blank">
          datatug.app <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://datatug.app/en/under-the-hood/tools-we-built/" target="_blank">
          了解這些開發工具 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">MeaningGraph</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          資料模型與語意定義的開放註冊表，定義保存在你自己的 Git 儲存庫中，並與模型和程式碼關聯。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://meaninggraph.io/" target="_blank">
          meaninggraph.io <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://meaninggraph.io/registry/" target="_blank">
          瀏覽註冊表 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">Codegrapher</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          程式碼圖引擎，用於快速程式碼探索以及規範與程式碼的雙向關聯。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://codegrapher.dev/" target="_blank">
          codegrapher.dev <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">DALgo</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          使用 SpecScore 規範的 Go 資料存取層。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://dal-go.github.io/" target="_blank">
          dal-go.github.io <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">inGitDB</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          使用 SpecScore 規範的基於 Git 的版本化資料庫。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://ingitdb.com/" target="_blank">
          ingitdb.com <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">Rehearse</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          驗收證據層——真實執行規範的驗收標準，檢查可重複使用，無需黏合程式碼。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://rehearse.ink" target="_blank">
          rehearse.ink <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="eco-card">
        <h3 class="eco-card__title">SpecScore Studio</h3>
        <p class="eco-card__body">
          用於檢視和編輯 SpecScore 規格的 Web UI。
        </p>
        <a class="eco-card__link" href="https://specscore.studio" target="_blank">
          specscore.studio <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .ecosystem { background: var(--cream); }
  .ecosystem__title {
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .ecosystem__grid {
    list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0;
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: var(--space-4);
  }
  .eco-card {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--graphite);
    padding-top: var(--space-2);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  }
  .eco-card__title { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .eco-card__body { color: var(--mid-ink); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.55; margin-bottom: var(--space-2); flex-grow: 1; }
  .eco-card__link { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 0.825rem; color: var(--ink-blue); border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; align-self: flex-start; }
  .eco-card__link:hover { color: var(--ink); border-bottom-color: var(--ink); }

  @media (max-width: 800px) { .ecosystem__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--space-3); } }
</style>
